# API

- Nest + PostgreSQL + Prisma 6. Session cookies + role Guards (`SUPER_ADMIN` | `ADMIN` | `FRONT_DESK`).
- HTTP envelope via `setupHttpContract()`; shared wire types from `packages/` (`@cabin/api-contract`) — do not redefine the same contract in this app.
- Staff identity is `Admin` (not guest `User`). Prisma client: `src/generated/prisma`.
- After schema change: `pnpm prisma:generate`. Root `.env` only (`DATABASE_URL`, `SESSION_SECRET`).
- DTOs with `class-validator`. No bare `any` on controllers.
- Prisma only inside services — not controllers.
- Controllers return domain objects only — never wrap `{ data }` by hand.
- Overlap checks in DB/transactions. Sources: `manual` | `website` | `booking_com` | `airbnb` | `agoda`.
- iCal updates PMS only — does not refresh OTAs.
- Read `apps/api/AGENTS.md` + `.cursor/rules/monorepo-tooling.mdc`.
